5,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Good evening, everyone. Since this is the first day and we have no information yet, I suggest we all observe each other's behavior and speaking patterns carefully. Let's keep the discussion calm and rational.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a wonderful idea, Minako. It is always best to start with a kind and patient heart. I look forward to getting to know all of you better as we talk.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Minako. Since we lack any concrete leads, establishing a baseline for everyone's behavior is the most logical first step. Let's see how everyone reacts as the game progresses.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A most sensible proposal. I shall happily play the role of the observer for now. Let us see whose mask slips first in this little dance of deception.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm so excited to play with everyone! I'll do my best to help find the werewolf, but let's all be friends while we do it! I'm ready!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,"It seems we are all in agreement. For now, I will simply listen. @Kenji, your energy is appreciated, but remember that the werewolf may try to use that friendliness to blend in.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, Minako, you are so thoughtful to warn us. But let's not be too hard on young Kenji; his spirit is such a breath of fresh air for us all, isn't it?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, while Kenji's energy is pleasant, we must remain objective. Emotional appeals can be a distraction. Let's focus on the facts and the patterns of our speech for now.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Mizuki. While spirit is charming, logic is our only true shield. I wonder if the werewolf is currently enjoying our polite introductions, feeling quite secure in the shadows.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not trying to hide anything! I just want us all to get along. But I'll be super careful and watch everyone closely, just like you said!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,pass,Minako,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"I shall do the same. It is a lovely evening for a conversation, and I am quite content to simply listen to your voices for a while.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,pass,Mizuki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I find myself in a similar state of contentment. There is a certain elegance in the silence before the storm, wouldn't you agree? I shall pass my turn as well.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll skip too! I'm just thinking about who might be the werewolf... but everyone seems so nice! I'll keep my eyes wide open!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minako,,"Since we have reached the end of the first day without any claims or suspicious behavior, I believe we have a good baseline. Let's conclude for today.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"It has been such a pleasure speaking with you all. I hope we can all sleep peacefully tonight and wake up to a bright, honest morning.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. We have a starting point now. I'll be interested to see if anyone's tone shifts tomorrow once the first divination is complete. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A delightful start to our game. I shall retire for the evening, though I suspect some of us will be far more active in the moonlight than others. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Goodnight, everyone! I hope we all have sweet dreams. I can't wait to see what happens tomorrow!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
