32,1,,status,Mizuki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
33,1,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
34,1,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
35,1,,status,Minako,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
36,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Good morning, everyone. Now that the first night has passed, the Seer should have some information. If anyone has a lead that can help the village, please share it with us calmly.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, dear ones. I hope you all rested well. I am curious to see if our Seer has found a path to the truth that can help us keep our village safe.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's see if anyone is willing to come forward. @Seer, if you have a clear lead, now is the time to share it. However, we should be cautious of anyone claiming the role too aggressively.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I find myself in a curious position. As the Seer, I have already cast my gaze upon Mizuki, and I can confirm she is human. A small victory for the village, though the wolf still lurks among us.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wow, Benjamin is the Seer! That's so cool! Thanks for telling us, Benjamin! Now we know Mizuki is a good person, so we can all trust her more, right?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Benjamin, thank you for coming forward. While your claim is helpful, we must consider the possibility that a werewolf is pretending to be the Seer to gain trust. @Mizuki, how do you feel about this result?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is such a relief to know that Mizuki is a kind soul. However, Minako makes a very wise point. We must be gentle with one another, but we must also be careful not to be misled.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I appreciate the confirmation, Benjamin, but I agree with Minako. A fake Seer often clears a player to build immediate trust. We must analyze why Benjamin chose to reveal himself and clear me so early.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Your skepticism is quite refreshing, Mizuki. It would be dreadfully boring if you all simply believed me. However, providing a confirmed human creates a stable pillar for our logic, which is far more efficient than guessing in the dark.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I think Benjamin is just trying to help us! If he's the Seer, he's being really brave by telling us so soon. Why would he lie to make us feel safer? I believe him!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, your trust is admirable, but we cannot afford to be naive. If Benjamin is the werewolf, he has just secured a potential ally in Mizuki. @Benjamin, who else do you intend to divine tonight?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Benjamin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is a difficult position to be in, isn't it? We all want to trust one another, but the shadows make it hard. I wonder if we can find a way to be both cautious and kind as we decide.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minako, you're right. By clearing me, Benjamin has effectively shifted the focus away from himself. @Benjamin, your answer to Minako's question will be telling. A real Seer's next target should be based on a logical strategy to narrow down the suspects.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"My strategy is simple: I shall seek to eliminate the remaining variables. Since Minako and Shizue have been the most cautious, I intend to divine one of them tonight to further solidify our circle of trust.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"That sounds like a great plan, Benjamin! If you can find more good people, we'll be even closer to catching the werewolf! I'm rooting for you to find the truth!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Minako,,"We have a claim and a confirmed human, but we must remain vigilant. Since Benjamin has cleared Mizuki, the suspicion now falls on the rest of us. I will trust the claim for now, but we must vote carefully.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is a heavy burden to decide who to vote for when we all seem so dear to one another. I shall follow the wisdom of the group, for harmony is the most precious thing we have.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"If we trust Benjamin, the suspects are Minako, Shizue, and Kenji. However, since we have no evidence of guilt, executing a villager now is a high risk. I suggest we vote for the person who seems most out of place.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minako"",""Shizue"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A high risk indeed, Mizuki. However, inaction is its own kind of gamble. If we must choose a target based on ""place,"" perhaps we should consider who benefits most from this atmosphere of uncertainty. I shall leave the final decision to your collective intuition.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I don't want anyone to be sad, but we have to find the werewolf! If Benjamin is the Seer, then it's one of us three. I'm a good person, so let's think really hard! I'll trust the group!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
