69,2,1,talk,Minako,,"Kenji has been executed, and Mizuki was attacked. This is a critical turn. If Benjamin is the Seer, the werewolf is among the remaining three of us. @Benjamin, please tell us the result of your divination from last night.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, poor Kenji... it breaks my heart that we had to say goodbye to such a spirited young man. And Mizuki, my dear, I am so sorry you were targeted. I hope you are doing alright. Benjamin, please, tell us what you found.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a tragedy indeed, though a predictable one. I regret to inform you that my gaze fell upon Shizue last night, and the result was most unsettling. Shizue, you are the werewolf.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Minako,,"This is a very direct accusation. If Benjamin is the Seer, the game ends here. However, if he is the werewolf, he is attempting to eliminate the final threat. @Shizue, please provide your defense.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, my goodness... I am truly heartbroken. Benjamin, I cannot believe you would say such a thing. I have only wished for peace and kindness among us. I am a simple villager, I promise you.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Your performance is quite touching, Shizue, truly. The ""simple villager"" act is a classic, though I find the contrast between your gentle words and your predatory nature to be almost poetic. Logic leaves us no other conclusion.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, your confidence is absolute, but we must consider the Possessed. If Shizue is the werewolf, the game ends now. But if Benjamin is the werewolf and Shizue is the Possessed, he might be sacrificing his ally to appear authentic. @Shizue, do you have any counter-argument?","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"I am just a grandmother who loves you all. It is so sad that we are fighting like this. If Benjamin is lying, he is using my kindness against me, and that is the most heartbreaking part of all. Please, look at my heart.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Looking at a heart is a lovely sentiment for a poem, Shizue, but a poor method for a trial. Logic is far more reliable than emotion, and the logic here is quite simple: I have seen your true nature. Your tears are merely a veil.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Minako,,"We have reached the final decision. If Benjamin is the Seer, Shizue is the werewolf. If Benjamin is the werewolf, he is lying to win. Since the werewolf's victory is imminent, we must trust the divination. I vote for Shizue.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is so very sad that it has come to this. I truly believe in the goodness of everyone here, and it pains me that you cannot see the truth in my eyes. I will accept your decision with a smile, for I love you all.","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A graceful exit, Shizue, though I suspect your smile is one of frustration rather than love. The curtain falls on this little drama, and the truth, however cold, finally prevails. I shall cast my vote with a clear conscience.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
